00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Shrek the Halls is a adventure, animation, comedy
film directed by Gary Trousdale.

2
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:54,000
The Christmas tree isn't the only thing green in this new holiday classic.

3
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:18,000
Shrek is back and trying to get into the spirit of the season.

4
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:42,000
After promising Fiona and the kids a Christmas they'll remember, he
is forced to take a crash course in the holiday.

5
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:06,000
But just when he thinks he has everything for their quiet family
Christmas just right, there is a knock at the door.

6
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:30,000
Shrek (voice), played by Mike Myers.

7
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:54,000
Donkey (voice), played by Eddie Murphy.

8
